My GPSr: N52° 57.574' W114° 01.44[b]3[/b]’&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was on my way to Battle Lake today to pick up what promised to be a great old cache. Alas, I didn’t find it and fear that’s a goner (although I hope I’m wrong). But I did find this cap on the way!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was a quick stop, snap and go session for this one!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

